; VIGIL: one trait Kit, one action - the DAMAGE POST reaction that offers the teleport reticle
; (rulings 2-3; the action's own header has the seam). The reaction's effect row is the card
; sentence verbatim, the Kit's own text, so Action.show_in_tooltip hides it as a duplicate and the
; trait card draws the Kit alone (the Naga close's "card text drawn once" rule). SP5: the trait and
; its reaction share ONE glyph (the icon directive); no icon_override until then.
[resource]
script = ExtResource("2_kit")
actions = Array[ExtResource("1_action")]([ExtResource("3_vigil")])
is_trait = true
